{"id":"decke","lemma":"Decke","pos":"noun","rank":1592,"glosses":["any cloth or cushion used as a covering; a tablecloth, blanket, quilt, duvet, etc.","ceiling (surface at the upper limit of a room or cavity)"],"ipa":"/ˈdɛkə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/De-Decke.ogg/De-Decke.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Decke","plural":"Decken"},"formAudio":{"Decken":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Decken.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich decke den Tisch.","en":"I'll set the table.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390647","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"dining table"}]},{"text":"Ich hole dir eine Decke.","en":"I'll get you a blanket.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to get, to fetch","l":"holen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Bitte gib mir eine Decke.","en":"Please give me a blanket.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Könntest du mir eine Decke bringen?","en":"Could you bring me a blanket?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to bring"}]},{"text":"Hier ist eine Decke.","en":"Here's a blanket.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}